#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client so you can run jobs on IBM quantum computers."
msgstr "Installiere den Qiskit Runtime-Client, um Jobs auf IBM-Quantencomputern auszuführen."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client"
msgstr "Den Qiskit Runtime-Client installieren"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"
msgstr "Den Qiskit Runtime-Client installieren {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing the Qiskit Runtime service.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime ist der cloudbasierte Dienst zur Ausführung von Quantenberechnungen auf IBM Quantum&reg;-Hardware. Diese Anleitung zeigt dir, wie du `qiskit-ibm-runtime` installierst – das Client-Paket für den Zugriff auf den Qiskit Runtime-Dienst.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the Qiskit Runtime client, follow the instructions in these guides:\n"
msgstr "Bevor du den Qiskit Runtime-Client installierst, folge den Anweisungen in diesen Anleitungen:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Qiskit installieren](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Dein IBM Cloud-Konto einrichten](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Führe diesen Befehl aus, um Qiskit Runtime zu installieren:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [Qiskit Runtime release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Bleib auf dem neuesten Stand\">\n"
"Schau regelmäßig in die [Qiskit Runtime-Versionshinweise](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes), um neue Releases zu verfolgen. Wir empfehlen, deine Anforderungen für `qiskit-ibm-runtime` häufig zu aktualisieren, indem du `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime` ausführst.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Nächste Schritte {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Empfehlungen\">\n"
"  - [Das Qiskit SDK aus dem Quellcode installieren](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Dein erstes Programm ausführen](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Probiere ein Tutorial aus, zum Beispiel [Grovers Algorithmus](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Lies die [Deprecation-Richtlinie](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
